        "Id1": {
            "text": "The movie English Without Tears' released on July 28, 1994. Produced by Anatole de Grunwald, it also featured Nicholas Brodszky's music compositions while he also worked as part of the non-performing staff."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Released on 07-28-1944, \"English Without Tears\" was produced by Anatole de Grunwald. Although Nicholas Brodszky has no background in performing, he composed the music for the film."
